{"id":"u-66dfc6e3-67dd-4e88-abc7-7c8b6925700a","src":"community","title":"30 Min Dumbbell Work","author":"Bhavin S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Cm3efW-30-min-dumbbell-work","desc":"The overarching purpose of this program is High-Density Performance Optimization.\n\nSpecifically, it is engineered to solve the three biggest problems lifters face:\n\nTime Elimination: It proves you don't need 90 minutes in a gym to build an elite physique. By capping the workout at 30 minutes and using strict 60-second rest intervals, it elevates your heart rate, torches calories, and forces massive muscular adaptation in a compressed window.\n\nGym Independence: By relying entirely on a single pair of dumbbells and a bench, you completely bypass the frustration of crowded commercial gyms. You never have to wait for a machine, change cable attachments, or walk across the room. Your entire workout happens in a 6x6 foot space.\n\nAthletic Longevity: Instead of just pumping isolated muscles, the combination of movements like the Dumbbell Swing, DB Thruster, High Pull, and Farmer Carry builds functional, explosive power, bulletproofs your joints, improves your grip strength, and builds a cardiovascular engine that supports your heavy lifts.\n\nIt is designed for the busy individual who refuses to compromise on strength, aesthetics, or athletic capability.","level":["Beginner","Novice","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":30,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-19T15:21:35.602Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Pull & Hinge","Push & Squat","Chest & Shoulders","Upper Body Density","Lower Body Densinty"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Dumbbell Swing","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Gorilla Row","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Dumbbell Tripod Row","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pullover (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Squat Thr